### JSON Architecture (Node-Based System Configuration)\n\n```json\n{\n  "workflowId": "wf_botanical_dye_optimizer_001",\n  "version": "1.0.0",\n  "nodes": [\n    {\n      "id": "node_image_input",\n      "type": "ui_input_image",\n      "title": "Plant / Material Photo",\n      "properties": {\n        "label": "Take or upload a photo of your dye material",\n        "supportedFormats": ["jpg", "png", "webp"]\n      },\n      "outputs": {\n        "image_data": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      "id": "node_weight_input",\n      "type": "ui_input_number",\n      "title": "Fabric Dry Weight",\n      "properties": {\n        "label": "Weight of dry fabric/yarn in grams",\n        "min": 1,\n        "max": 10000,\n        "default": 100\n      },\n      "outputs": {\n        "value": 100\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      "id": "node_fiber_select",\n      "type": "ui_dropdown",\n      "title": "Fabric Fiber Type",\n      "properties": {\n        "label": "Select your textile composition",\n        "options": [\n          {"label": "Animal/Protein (Wool, Silk)", "value": "protein"},\n          {"label": "Plant/Cellulose (Cotton, Linen, Hemp)", "value": "cellulose"}\n        ],\n        "default": "cellulose"\n      },\n      "outputs": {\n        "selected_value": "cellulose"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      "id": "node_ai_vision_identifier",\n      "type": "ai_inference_vision",\n      "title": "AI Bioart Identifier",\n      "properties": {\n        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",\n        "system_prompt": "You are an expert botanical dye master. Analyze the image to identify the plant material or food waste. Output a JSON object containing: \'scientific_name\', \'common_name\', \'recommended_wof_percentage\' (as an integer representing the ideal plant-to-fabric ratio), and \'recommended_mordant_modifier\' (e.g., \'requires_tannin\' for cellulose fibers or \'alum_only\' for protein)."\n      },\n      "inputs": {\n        "image": {\n          "nodeId": "node_image_input",\n          "outputKey": "image_data"\n        }\n      },\n      "outputs": {\n        "json_response": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      "id": "node_ratio_calculator",\n      "type": "logic_math_script",\n      "title": "Recipe Calculation Engine",\n      "properties": {\n        "script": "const weight = inputs.fabric_weight;\\nconst fiber = inputs.fiber_type;\\nconst aiData = JSON.parse(inputs.ai_analysis);\\n\\nlet mordantName = \'Alum (Potassium Aluminum Sulfate)\';\\nlet mordantWeight = weight * 0.15;\\nlet extraSteps = [];\\n\\nif (fiber === \'cellulose\') {\\n  mordantName = \'Aluminum Acetate\';\\n  mordantWeight = weight * 0.05;\\n  if (aiData.recommended_mordant_modifier === \'requires_tannin\') {\\n    extraSteps.push(\'Pre-treat fabric with Tannin powder (10% WOF) before mordanting.\');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nreturn {\\n  commonName: aiData.common_name,\\n  requiredPlantWeight: weight * (aiData.recommended_wof_percentage / 100),\\n  mordantType: mordantName,\\n  mordantGrams: mordantWeight,\\n  scourType: fiber === \'protein\' ? \'Neutral soap bath (60°C)\' : \'Soda ash simmer (90°C)\',\\n  additionalNotes: extraSteps.join(\' \')\\n};"\n      },\n      "inputs": {\n        "fabric_weight": {\n          "nodeId": "node_weight_input",\n          "outputKey": "value"\n        },\n        "fiber_type": {\n          "nodeId": "node_fiber_select",\n          "outputKey": "selected_value"\n        },\n        "ai_analysis": {\n          "nodeId": "node_ai_vision_identifier",\n          "outputKey": "json_response"\n        }\n      },\n      "outputs": {\n        "result_object": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      "id": "node_markdown_template",\n      "type": "template_generator",\n      "title": "Compile Recipe Card",\n      "properties": {\n        "template": "# Botanical Dye Recipe: {{calc.commonName}}\\n\\n### 1. Preparation (Scouring)\\n* Clean your fabric using a **{{calc.scourType}}** to remove oils, waxes, and starches that block dye absorption.\\n\\n### 2. Mordanting (Color Fixing)\\n* Weigh out **{{calc.mordantGrams}}g** of **{{calc.mordantType}}**.\\n* Dissolve in warm water, add wet fabric, and simmer gently for 1 hour. {{calc.additionalNotes}}\\n\\n### 3. Dye Extraction & Immersion\\n* Weigh out **{{calc.requiredPlantWeight}}g** of your foraged {{calc.commonName}}.\\n* Simmer the plant parts in water for 1 hour to extract the pigment. Strain out solids.\\n* Add your pre-mordanted, wet fabric into the liquid. Simmer for 1 hour, then let cool overnight for maximum vibrancy."\n      },\n      "inputs": {\n        "calc": {\n          "nodeId": "node_ratio_calculator",\n          "outputKey": "result_object"\n        }\n      },\n      "outputs": {\n        "markdown_text": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      "id": "node_ui_display",\n      "type": "ui_display_markdown",\n      "title": "Your Custom Recipe Card",\n      "properties": {},\n      "inputs": {\n        "text": {\n          "nodeId": "node_markdown_template",\n          "outputKey": "markdown_text"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  "connections": [\n    {"from": {"nodeId": "node_image_input", "outputKey": "image_data"}, "to": {"nodeId": "node_ai_vision_identifier", "inputKey": "image"}},\n    {"from": {"nodeId": "node_weight_input", "outputKey": "value"}, "to": {"nodeId": "node_ratio_calculator", "inputKey": "fabric_weight"}},\n    {"from": {"nodeId": "node_fiber_select", "outputKey": "selected_value"}, "to": {"nodeId": "node_ratio_calculator", "inputKey": "fiber_type"}},\n    {"from": {"nodeId": "node_ai_vision_identifier", "outputKey": "json_response"}, "to": {"nodeId": "node_ratio_calculator", "inputKey": "ai_analysis"}},\n    {"from": {"nodeId": "node_ratio_calculator", "outputKey": "result_object"}, "to": {"nodeId": "node_markdown_template", "inputKey": "calc"}},\n    {"from": {"nodeId": "node_markdown_template", "outputKey": "markdown_text"}, "to": {"nodeId": "node_ui_display", "inputKey": "text"}}\n  ]\n}\n\n```\n\n### Help & Sources\nFor text-based do